  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the mung bean sprouts and set them aside to drain.",
    "In a large pot, sauté the diced onion and minced garlic in a little water until softened.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and ancho chili powder to the pot and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Add the hominy, vegetable broth, and mung bean sprouts to the pot, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes, or until the flavors have melded together.",
    "Stir in the lime juice and salt.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the pozole hot, garnished with toasted pepitas and a sprinkle of smoked paprika."
